      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI error triage and auto-retry\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nEvery other workflow points here when it fails. The failure is checked against known incidents so one outage doesn't become fifty alerts.\n\nA new failure gets its execution data pulled and an AI classifies it: transient, data problem or real bug. Transient failures are retried automatically after a pause. Everything else gets an enriched alert with the cause.\n\nRepeats bump a counter, and anything that keeps failing escalates to the owner.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
